sequenceDiagram
  participant U as You
  participant M as Model
  participant H as Claude Code (host)
  participant S as neo4j-mcp-server
  participant D as Neo4j (music)
  U->>M: Create playlist P09 ... show the Cypher and wait for my approval
  M-->>U: Proposed statement (a courtesy, not a control)
  U->>M: approved
  M->>H: Request write-cypher {query}
  Note over H: Manual mode: dialog shows the statement<br/>1. Yes  2. Yes, and don't ask again  3. No
  U->>H: 1. Yes
  H->>S: tools/call over stdio
  S->>D: Statement, one transaction (Bolt)
  D-->>S: Rows, and an entry in query.log as MCP4NEO4J/2.1.1
  S-->>H: content[0].text = rows as JSON, isError=false
  H->>M: Tool result
  M-->>U: Report of the change
  Note over U,D: Verify outside the conversation: Query tool read-back,<br/>database.py check, query_log.py
